Depends: libc6, libssl3 | libssl1.1, libgtk-3-0, libxdo3
Description: Quick Download Manager - Modern Open-Source Downloader in Rust & Iced
 Quick Download Manager (QDM) is a fast, lightweight, and modern open-source download manager built with Rust and Iced. It supports segmented multi-connection HTTP/HTTPS downloads, BitTorrent/magnet links, speed throttling, scheduling, and automatic updates.
